<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχωρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>give room</i> to do a thing, <i>allow</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ χρὁνος οὐκ ἐγχωρεῖ</span>, c.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				26.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				12.13
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσον ἐνεχώρεε ἡ
			δεκάτη</span> so far as the money <i>allowed</i> her to go,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.135
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν ἐγχωρῇ τὸ ὕδωρ</span>
			(i.e. the water-clock), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				44.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>admit of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					11.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχωρεῖ</span>, impers., <i>there is
				time, it is possible</i> or <i>allowable</i>, c. dat. pers.
			et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. αὐτῷ εἰδέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					1.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				321d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.16
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷς ἐ. ὑβρισταῖς εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					24.15
				</span></i>
			: also abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτι ἐ.</span>
			<i>there is</i> yet <i>time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				116e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκέτ᾽ ἐγχωρεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.41
				</span></i>
			; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδέχεται</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				25b10
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ὁπόσον ἂν ἐγχωρῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχωροῦν ἐστί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					3.24.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὸ ἐγχωροῦν</span> as far
			as <i>possible</i>, Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				6.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pass</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἑτέραν ὑποθήκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					907.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
